  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Forme(s) et modes d’être / Form(s) and Modes of Being (2016), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has been cited 2 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Forme(s) et modes d’être / Form(s) and Modes of Being by Olivier Malherbe and Sébastien Richard was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2016. It is part of the Philosophie et Politique / Philosophy and Politics series. Conceptually, the work connects to Physics and Philosophy.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 2 citations. Citations peaked in 2020 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include International Journal of Philosophical Studies and History of analytic philosophy. The citing works include 1 journal article and 1 book chapter. They come from 2 countries, led by Austria and Belgium.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">No teaching use, downloads or public discussion have been recorded for it yet.</p>",
